":764561}]}]}],"unsupported":false},{"id":32818,"col":"headbangbang","cat":"Special Blend","name":"EggBanga","desc":"🌟 **Welcome to the HeadBangaz Special Blend! 🚀**\n\nEmbark on a special blending adventure and unlock weekly rewards in the HeadBangaz universe. Follow these steps to reveal the magic:\n\n**1. Collect MadNests:**\n🏡 Gather 5 MadNests NFTs by opening packs. Nests are the key to unlocking the first stage of our special blend.\n\n**2. Blend MadNests into EggBanga:**\n🥚 Combine 5 Nests to create 1 EggBanga NFT. Eggs mark the beginning of the weekly reward journey.\n\n**3. Blend EggBangaz into StunnedNugget:**\n🐣 Blend 3 EggBangaz to form 1 StunnedNugget NFT. Birds represent the next stage of our special blend.\n\n**4. Final Blend: StunnedNuggets into La Chickitita or Señor Roostvelt:**\n🐤 Blend 2 StunnedNuggets with a 50% chance of obtaining either 1 La Chickitita NFT or 1 Señor Roostvelt NFT.\n\n**Weekly Rewards: Hold Chicken and Rooster Together!**\n🍳 Collectors holding both Chicken and Rooster NFTs will receive 1 Egg NFT per week, ensuring a consistent stream of rewards.\n\nGet ready to enjoy weekly surprises and dive into the rewards offered by HeadBangaz. \nStart your special blend now and experience the magic unfold!\n","img":"QmUGmdKZFBsuPPmXHXktncKV4oWudyyc1rJ7RXCiQ4wKdw","start":0,"end":0,"max":0,"security":null,"ing":[{"index":0,"count":5,"burn":true,"to":null,"kind":"template","collection":"headbangbang","templateId":763420}],"rolls":[{"total":1,"outcomes":[{"odds":1,"results":[{"kind":"mint","templateId":763421}]}]}],"unsupported":false},{"id":32817,"col":"headbangbang","cat":"Farm Animals","name":"Boss Horse","desc":"Welcome to the HeadBangaz Blend Center! 🚀\n\nDiscover the magic of blending in the HeadBangaz universe. Combine specific items to create charming farm animals and unlock fantastic rewards.\n\nCommon Blends - Create Your Companions (Blend 5 Items):\n\n🌿 Donkey Chew: 5x Hazey Blazey\n🦆 Lucky Ducky: 5x BubbaFish\n🌸 Sheep'A'Inu: 5x MazyDaisy\n🍃 Not_ThanksGiving_Turkey: 5x LeafMeAlone\n🥕 Tear Piglet: 5x RootyCarrot\n🌳 Goat W. Bush: 5x BangaBush\n\nRare Blends - Unlock Extraordinary Friends (Blend 10 Items):\n\n🐇 Bloods Bunny: 10x El Ketchup\n🦢 GooseBump: 10x Dead-Fish\n🐄 Cow-a-Banga: 10x Baby Husher\n🐎 Boss Horse: 10x HB Cuban Cigar\n\nCollect all animals to complete your Farm Animals set and enjoy special rewards!\n\n**Completing the Full Set Reward:**\n\n🚀 Revenue Share: Collectors completing the set *receive a share of the Farm Animals drop revenue*.\n🌈 1 of 1 NFT: The first collector to complete the set gets a unique 1 of 1 NFT and a larger revenue share.\n\nBegin blending now and let the adventure unfold! 🌟","img":"Qmf2v8LFnp763J8XKbEy58wA6eXhcSefoVKdVncA3KRzyE","start":0,"end":0,"max":0,"security":null,"ing":[{"index":0,"count":10,"burn":true,"to":null,"kind":"template","collection":"headbangbang","templateId":763417}],"rolls":[{"total":1,"outcomes":[{"odds":1,"results":[{"kind":"mint","templateId":763409}]}]}],"unsupported":false},{"id":32816,"col":"headbangbang","cat":"Farm Animals","name":"Bloods Bunny","desc":"","img":"QmUqU2PRLN7723PhEbtAkrmpryBSCYJVHeBASbregwU2BQ","start":0,"end":0,"max":0,"security":null,"ing":[{"index":0,"count":10,"burn":true,"to":null,"kind":"template","collection":"headbangbang","templateId":763419}],"rolls":[{"total":1,"outcomes":[{"odds":1,"results":[{"kind":"mint","templateId":763408}]}]}],"unsupported":false},{"id":32815,"col":"headbangbang","cat":"Farm Animals","name":"Cow-a-Banga","desc":"","img":"QmPr7gJm68BfyqQVJxEjmgmyy4CT5sgFJvKPszpWW3dkBf","start":0,"end":0,"max":0,"security":null,"ing":[{"index":0,"count":10,"burn":true,"to":null,"kind":"template","collection":"headbangbang","templateId":763416}],"rolls":[{"total":1,"outcomes":[{"odds":1,"results":[{"kind":"mint","templateId":763407}]}]}],"unsupported":false},{"id":32813,"col":"headbangbang","cat":"Farm Animals","name":"GooseBump","desc":"","img":"QmUE8sVwwEsQk8xo2uaAtVMGf7qT4RgCh2DW3imBuhAfzC","star